Inspect software artifacts before trusted promotion

Usage:
  helox [flags]
  helox [command]

Available Commands:
  cargo       Inspect and build public crates.io packages
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  doctor      Check installed release and trusted Host runtime readiness
  github      Inspect and install public GitHub Release assets
  go          Inspect and build public Go Modules
  help        Help about any command
  npm         Inspect and install npm registry packages
  pip         Inspect and install PyPI distributions
  pypi        Inspect and install PyPI distributions
  terraform   Install public Terraform Providers

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for helox

Use "helox [command] --help" for more information about a command.
